        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&lt;Finding Cats&gt;: A Furry Fairy Tale Hidden-Object Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863800/extras/fac7667c189aea3ca2080a821b031e3e.poster.avif?t=1766503848\" width=987 height=371 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863800/extras/fac7667c189aea3ca2080a821b031e3e.webm?t=1766503848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dive into a fairy tale world made of paws and purrs? <i>Cats Everywhere</i> is a uniquely creative hidden-object and clicker adventure that gives the beloved story of Snow White a fantastic &quot;feline&quot; twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay &amp; Experience:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fairy Tale Scenes, Feline Hunt:</strong> Explore beautifully recreated classic scenes from Snow White. But this time, you must scour these detailed scenes with a sharp eye to find all the cleverly hidden cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click to Discover:</strong> The gameplay is simple and intuitive. Just move and click your mouse to mark each discovered cat, enjoying the pure joy of finding them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Horde of Cats to Collect:</strong> Countless cats are hiding in every nook and cranny! From a regal &quot;Prince Cat&quot; to chubby &quot;Dwarf Cats,&quot; every uniquely designed feline is waiting to be discovered and added to your album.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Fairy Tales Meet Cats:</strong> This is the core charm! Witness the classic tale retold by an all-cat cast, filled with unexpected humor and warmth. Is the Evil Queen a haughty Persian? Are the seven dwarfs a bunch of cute Munchkins? Discover the purr-fect parody for yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Rich with Details:</strong> Every scene is meticulously illustrated, not only capturing the fairy tale magic but also packed with fun feline-themed details and Easter eggs, rewarding your careful exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling all cat lovers and fairy tale fans! Sharpen your &quot;cat-like reflexes&quot; and step into this magical, adorable world for a cozy and addictive hidden-object adventure!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&lt;Finding Cats&gt;: A Furry Fairy Tale Hidden-Object Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863800/extras/fac7667c189aea3ca2080a821b031e3e.poster.avif?t=1766503848\" width=987 height=371 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863800/extras/fac7667c189aea3ca2080a821b031e3e.webm?t=1766503848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to dive into a fairy tale world made of paws and purrs? <i>Cats Everywhere</i> is a uniquely creative hidden-object and clicker adventure that gives the beloved story of Snow White a fantastic &quot;feline&quot; twist!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay &amp; Experience:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fairy Tale Scenes, Feline Hunt:</strong> Explore beautifully recreated classic scenes from Snow White. But this time, you must scour these detailed scenes with a sharp eye to find all the cleverly hidden cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click to Discover:</strong> The gameplay is simple and intuitive. Just move and click your mouse to mark each discovered cat, enjoying the pure joy of finding them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Horde of Cats to Collect:</strong> Countless cats are hiding in every nook and cranny! From a regal &quot;Prince Cat&quot; to chubby &quot;Dwarf Cats,&quot; every uniquely designed feline is waiting to be discovered and added to your album.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When Fairy Tales Meet Cats:</strong> This is the core charm! Witness the classic tale retold by an all-cat cast, filled with unexpected humor and warmth. Is the Evil Queen a haughty Persian? Are the seven dwarfs a bunch of cute Munchkins? Discover the purr-fect parody for yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Rich with Details:</strong> Every scene is meticulously illustrated, not only capturing the fairy tale magic but also packed with fun feline-themed details and Easter eggs, rewarding your careful exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calling all cat lovers and fairy tale fans! Sharpen your &quot;cat-like reflexes&quot; and step into this magical, adorable world for a cozy and addictive hidden-object adventure!</p>",
        "short_description": "&lt;Finding Cats&gt; is a purr-fect hidden object game! The world of Snow White has been taken over by cats. Sharpen your eyes to find all the cleverly hidden felines in beautifully reimagined classic scenes and discover endless furry surprises!",
